#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-repurposed.rst:9
#: ab3623be0c954e44834899c4bb538649
msgid ""
"The original solution for transmitting ArduPilot telemetry data over the "
"FrSky telemetry link was to reuse FrSky data messages meant for another "
"purpose and/or reserved by FrSky for their sensors. For example in this "
"protocol the Flight mode is sent using the tmp1 message instead of the "
"temperature. If you are not using an FrSky temperature sensor on your "
"vehicle, this will not cause any problem. But if you intend to use "
"temperature, other FrSky sensors, this telemetry protocol will cause "
"conflicts with them."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 通过 FrSky 数传链路传输数据的原始方案中，复用了本用于其他目的或由 FrSky 为其传感器保留的 FrSky "
"数据消息。例如，在该协议中，飞行模式通过 tmp1 消息（而非温度）发送。如果您的飞行器上没有使用 FrSky "
"温度传感器，这不会造成任何问题。但如果您打算使用温度或其他 FrSky 传感器，该数传协议将与其产生冲突。"

