#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-repurposed.rst:74
#: c3a2b06e2187459eae788838730538c3
msgid ""
"If upgrading to OpenTX 2.1+ you will need to replace your OpenTX 2.0 "
"configuration and \"discover\" your sensors. There are other minor "
"\"oddities\" - for example T1 (flight mode) and Tt2 (number of sats) are "
"both called TEMP (switching mode helps you identify which is which)."
msgstr ""
"如果升级到 OpenTX 2.1+，您需要替换 OpenTX 2.0 配置并重新「自动发现」传感器。还有一些细微的「差异」——例如，T1（飞行模式）和 "
"T2（卫星数量）都显示为 TEMP（切换模式可帮助您区分哪个是哪个）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-repurposed.rst:83
#: 56864467f9ca420c983309a9f8054bf8
msgid ""
"FrSky telemetry data consists of 16 or 32bit unsigned integers recognized by"
" OpenTX. Standard FrSky telemetry does not include autopilot messages "
"natively. Therefore, less important telemetry data messages (temperature, "
"variometer…) have been repurposed to carry more useful information such as "
"flight mode."
msgstr ""
"FrSky 数传数据由 OpenTX 识别的 16 或 32 位无符号整数组成。标准 FrSky "
"数传原生不包含飞控消息。因此，不太重要的数传数据消息（温度、升降速率计……）被复用来承载更有用的信息，如飞行模式。"

