#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-repurposed.rst:94
#: 3690d0c2b18343f6b0dcade7b1b6d906
msgid ""
"In the example below, the variometer function of OpenTX is configured to use"
" the discovered VSpd sensor value. The value is only considered if it is "
"between -10m/s and 10m/s. In the center band -0.5 to 0.5 m/s the variometer "
"will be silent."
msgstr ""
"在下面的示例中，OpenTX 的升降速率计功能配置为使用自动发现的 VSpd 传感器值。只有当值在 -10m/s 到 10m/s 之间时才有效。在 "
"-0.5 到 0.5 m/s 的中间频带内，升降速率计将保持静音。"

